Description: Chilean school grade scale calculator (1.0 to 7.0)
 Calculates the Chilean 1.0-7.0 grade scale for any exigence and score, grades
 for a whole class with average and distribution, and exports to PDF, Excel,
 Word, CSV and image. Works offline. Interface in Spanish.
